Package: bcsv
Type: Package
Title: Read, Write, Document, and Validate Better CSV Files
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Behaverse", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@behaverse.org"))
Description: Tools for working with CSV files paired with bcsv (Better CSV)
    metadata, a JSON-LD extension of W3C CSVW. Reads typed columns (including
    ordered/unordered factors, units, multiple NA codes), writes paired CSV +
    metadata with SHA-256 integrity hashes, generates draft metadata from a
    tibble, and validates a CSV against its metadata. Stays in lock-step with
    the Python 'bcsv' package; both implementations are exercised against a
    shared conformance fixture suite.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://behaverse.org/schemas/bcsv/
BugReports: https://github.com/behaverse/bcsv-r/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    digest,
    jsonlite,
    jsonvalidate,
    readr,
    tibble,
    yaml
Suggests:
    hms,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    quarto
VignetteBuilder: quarto
Config/testthat/edition: 3
